# SONS of BANE Audit Tool — Authentication Config
# ================================================
# Copy this file to ".env" (same folder as sob_audit.py) and fill in your
# browser session cookie from auth.sonsofbane.com.
#
# How to get your cookie:
#   1. Log in to https://auth.sonsofbane.com in Chrome
#   2. Open DevTools (F12) → Application tab → Cookies → auth.sonsofbane.com
#   3. Copy the VALUES of `sessionid` and `csrftoken`
#
# Option A — paste the full Cookie header (recommended, matches what Chrome sends):
SESSION_COOKIE="sessionid=esvzjlsitrs7pdknywjdoi5caav21g4a; csrftoken=uRJIryiUp9eEvSNJQfvrM7xJmakeugxA"

# Option B — paste individual values (uncomment if you prefer this):
# SESSIONID=PASTE_SESSION_ID_HERE
# CSRFTOKEN=PASTE_CSRF_TOKEN_HERE

# Notes:
#   - The session cookie typically lasts 2 weeks. Re-copy if you get auth errors.
#   - Do NOT commit .env to version control. Add it to .gitignore.
#   - This tool only READS data; it never POSTs or modifies anything on the site.
